-03-07T22:59:10Z","body":"It looks like both of these tests are failing in TSAN. In tablet-split-itest.cc, we have a utility helper method WriteRowsAndFlush, which we use to set up tables with data before splitting them. It seems in TSAN, with some reliability, one of the tservers does not receive the FlushTablets RPC, and the async flush task created by the flush manager is not retried:\r\n\r\n```\r\nW0307 22:50:58.883836   907 async_rpc_tasks.cc:292] 8ab6ea99fccc427c8b76e459c12dcba2 Flush Tablets RPC (task=0x00007b4c00110218, state=kRunning): TS 8ab6ea99fccc427c8b76e459c12dcba2: Flush Tablets RPC failed for tablet : Timed out (yb/rpc/outbound_call.cc:493): FlushTablets RPC (request call id 34566) to 127.0.0.7:26488 timed out after 10.000s\r\nW0307 22:50:58.884191   907 async_rpc_tasks.cc:342] 8ab6ea99fccc427c8b76e459c12dcba2 Flush Tablets RPC (task=0x00007b4c00110218, state=kRunning): Aborted (yb/master/async_rpc_tasks.cc:341): Reached maximum number of retries (0) for request 8ab6ea99fccc427c8b76e459c12dcba2 Flush Tablets RPC, task=0x7b4c00110218 state=kRunning\r\n```\r\n\r\nWe then continue to call IsFlushTablesDone, which repeatedly responds no, until the client times out and the test fails","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/1061226437/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"robertsami","id":1457684,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NTc2ODQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1457684?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertsami","html_url":"https://github.com/robertsami","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertsami/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertsami/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertsami/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://a